<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69904" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτίλλομαι</span></b> , only pres. and
			impf. (exc. aor.
		subj.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτίλεται <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span></span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Od.
			4.672
		</span></i> (prob.), inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτίλασθαι <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span></span>
		<i><span class="en">
			D.C.
			56.3
		</span></i>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sail, go by
				sea,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτίλεται εἵνεκα πατρός</span>
			Od.l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				14.246
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.163
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.5
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				717
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				793
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. τὴν [θάλασσαν]</span>”
				<i>sail on, navigate,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.202
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτιλίαν ναυτίλλεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					551c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the
			nautilus, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κενῷ [τῷ ὀστράκῳ] ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					622b9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph., of
			water-fowl, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				1.9
			</span></i>.</div>
